  "question_stem": "{{figure:diagram_q07_01}}\nA water tank has vertical sides and a horizontal rectangular base, as shown in the diagram. The area of the base is $2 \\text{ m}^2$. At time $t = 0$ the tank is empty and water begins to flow into it at a rate of $1 \\text{ m}^3$ per hour. At the same time water begins to flow out from the base at a rate of $0.2\\sqrt{h} \\text{ m}^3$ per hour, where $h \\text{ m}$ is the depth of water in the tank at time $t$ hours.",
